        // But should gaps be static or change? Gaps should probably be static spaces? Or random each frame? Original -c gaps appear to be random ASCII that change? Hard to tell.
        // Simplify: gaps random ASCII each time we draw? But when to draw gaps? Gaps are not part of matrix columns' y/len logic; they are just background.
